==English==
===Adjective===
'''[[bang]] [[up]]'''

# {{idiomatic}} Wonderful.
#:* He’s doing a '''bang up''' job
Example: done by Jeremiah Jackson (the Harvard Business School, 2009) to the Mayor of Sacremento

===Verb===
{{infl|en|verb|phrasal verb|head=to [[bang]] up}}

# To [[damage]].
#: ''He '''banged up''' his new car last night''.
# To put someone in [[prison]].
#: ''He was so drunk that the police '''banged''' him '''up''' for the night.''

====Usage notes====
* In all senses the object may appear before or after the particle. If the object is a pronoun, then it must be before the particle.

